{'symbol': 'PARA', 'date': '2022-04-01 17:52:00', 'title': 'PARAMOUNT GLOBAL ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION OF APPROXIMATELY $1.0 BILLION OF NOTES', 'text': 'NEW YORK , APRIL 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PARAMOUNT GLOBAL (THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: PARA, PARAA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WOULD REDEEM (I) ALL OF ITS OUTSTANDING 3.50% SENIOR NOTES DUE JANUARY 15, 2025 (THE "3.50% NOTES") AND (II) A PORTION OF ITS OUTSTANDING 4.750% SENIOR NOTES DUE MAY 15, 2025 (THE "4.750% NOTES").\xa0 THE REDEMPTION DATE FOR THE 3.50% NOTES IS APRIL 18, 2022.'}